00:03:58.280 --> 00:04:04.120
tuning. One thing worth watching is that astronomers continue to raise concerns over the planned

00:04:04.120 --> 00:04:10.380
dense AI compute constellation and its potential permanent impact on ground-based observations.

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:16.580
Existing wide field surveys are already contending with star link trains and the new planes would

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:22.940
add both light pollution and radio interference unless narrower shells or onboard optical mitigation

00:04:22.940 --> 00:04:29.060
